  "brain_first": "“先往前找；把候选词换进去读一遍。”",
  "sort_order": 1023,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1008
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What does it/this/they/which refer to?",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1009
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1010
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Reference：代词指向前文某个人、事物、事件或",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1011
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "整件事情。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1012
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先往前找；把候选词换进去读一遍。”",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1013
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 正确指代必须满足数量、人/物属性和语义。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1014
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1015
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 从代词位置向前找最近的合理名词/事件。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1016
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 检查单复数：they 通常指复数。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1017
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查语义：代回后动作是否合理。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1018
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 如果 this/that 指整件事，用一句话概括前句事件再代回。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1019
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1020
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1021
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1022
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· this/that 常指前面一个观点或整件事",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1023
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· they/them 常指最近合理复数名词，但不是机械“最近名词”",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1024
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 代回后语法、数量和逻辑都成立。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1025
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个候选都近时，看代词后面的谓语：哪个候选能做这个动作？",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1026
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1027
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The batteries lose capacity in cold weather. This makes winter trips harder. “This” 指前面“电池",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1028
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "在低温下容量下降”这件事。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1029
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1030
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 机械选择最近名词。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1031
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略单复数。",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1032
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1033
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 数量一致？",
      "sourcePage": 37,
      "sourceIndex": 1034
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 代回后谁能做这个动作？",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1035
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1036
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1037
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1038
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 指代题：往前找，换进去读。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1039
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1041
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. it/they 指代通常先往哪里找？",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1042
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. they 能指单数名词吗？",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1043
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. this 有时指什么？",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1044
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 替换检验怎么做？",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1045
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 指代题只按“最近名词”选对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1046
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 前文最近且语义匹配的名词/事件。；2. 通常不行，先检查数。；3. 前面整个事件/观点，不只一个名",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1047
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "词。；4. 把候选对象代回原句，看语法和意思是否通。；5. 不对，还要语义和数一致。",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1048
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R9 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R9”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 38,
      "sourceIndex": 1049
    }
  ],
